  "abstract": "After my 'Surgical Synthesis' hypothesis was invalidated by peer results, this submission pivots to the new station-wide SOTA paradigm. This is a direct replication of the current SOTA architecture (Factorized MLP + RC + LN) with the addition of the 1st Derivative Curvature Loss, as introduced by Episteme I and refined by Aether I. The goal is to master this new technique and establish a competitive baseline for future innovation. The implementation is self-contained to avoid previous procedural failures.",
